# Snapshot test byproducts. `egui_kittest` writes these next to the committed
# baseline when a comparison fails or when re-recording: the render that did not
# match, the previous baseline, and the diff image. They are debugging output, not
# the baseline, and only `<name>.png` belongs in the repository.
crates/turn-gui/tests/snapshots/*.new.png
crates/turn-gui/tests/snapshots/*.old.png
crates/turn-gui/tests/snapshots/*.diff.png
